      "value": "ya i noticed this. all hiding blocked people does is give malicious people more power. like usually its obvious if someone who blocks you is in the lobby when people are talking to nothing. iv seen it far more often used by malicious people to get away with stuff for longer by blocking the owner or like admins in events. like i understand removing it from obvious view even if i dont agree with they. but removing it everywhere only helps bad people. like malicious people can already still see you if you block them usually.",
