      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "this will additionally just make a larger divide between api tool and client users. as a normal user you literally can't kick or do anything if somone blocks you there's so many ways to exploit this. the only ones able to get around it are client users who are unaffected and people who know how to use vrcx and other log parsing tools to see whose in the instance which isent alot of people. im saying this for everyone who host events or anything that would be a target for bad actors. this is going to be exploited so badly. dont wana follow rules at a event or crash lobby and haras someone just block everyone who can stop or kick you. i really hope this isent in the final version.",
