      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 12
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In my opinion, the fact that you are blocked by someone in an instance, should never be a hidden fact. One could even argue that it should be easier to find out if someone in the instance has you blocked.\nIt is incredibly disruptive to the social experience to hang out with friends, and have someone in the instance that has you blocked, and you don't realize it, causing confusion and awkwardness for everyone when you try to figure out why the conversation seems disjointed without continuity.\nAs well, hiding this information from the user harms those who play the game without mods, while those with mods have all the benefits to work around these kinds of situations.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
